cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  HOB: A Free, Open-Source Obsidian-Based Research Management
  System for Scientific Workflows
message: If you use HOB in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tiburtini
    given-names: Manuel
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4985-3058"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bendlexane/HOB"
abstract: >-
  HOB is a free and open-source Obsidian vault template acting as a
  Research Management System for scientific workflows. It adds a
  stage-based folder taxonomy, structured templates, a dashboard, a
  scheduler, a Zotero pipeline, Bayesian project-duration forecasting,
  KPI collection, self-observability checks, and a vault-aware AI layer
  scoped to the knowledge folder. Research records remain plain Markdown
  files on the researcher's own machine.
keywords:
  - research management system
  - Obsidian
  - local-first software
  - Markdown
  - research workflow automation
  - Bayesian forecasting
  - electronic lab notebook
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 1.0.0-beta
date-released: "2026-08-22"
